Test: index() function
--------------------------------------
  String tests:
  index("World", "Hello World"): 7
  index("Hello", "Hello World"): 1
  index("lo", "Hello World"): 4
  index("o", "Hello World"): 5
  index("xyz", "Hello World"): 0
  index("", "Hello World"): 1

  String edge cases:
  index("abc", ""): 0
  index("", ""): 1
  index("abc", "abc"): 1
  index("abc", "abcabc"): 1

  Array tests:
  Array: ["apple", "banana", "cherry", "date"]
  index("banana", arr): 2
  index("apple", arr): 1
  index("date", arr): 4
  index("grape", arr): 0

  Array with numbers:
  Array: [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
  index(20, nums): 2
  index(50, nums): 5
  index(99, nums): 0

  Array edge cases:
  index("item", []): 0
  index("only", ["only"]): 1
  index("missing", ["only"]): 0
  index("a", ["a", "b", "a", "c", "a"]): 1
  index("c", ["a", "b", "a", "c", "a"]): 4
